# Mycosynth Lattice (turn 1), then March of the Machines (turn 3). Layer 4: the Lattice makes every permanent an artifact;
# March's "each noncreature artifact is an artifact creature" depends on it (CR 613.8a: applying the Lattice's effect changes
# what March's applies to - a land becomes a noncreature artifact) and applies after it. Every noncreature permanent is then
# an artifact creature, March itself among them (it is an artifact now, and March says "each", not "each other"). Layer 7b:
# each has power and toughness equal to its mana value. The lands (mana value 0) and the Moxes are 0/0 and die (CR 704.5f,
# March's ruling of artifact lands): Bot1's Plains and Moxes, Bot2's Island. Sol Ring is 1/1, March 4/4, the Lattice 6/6.
# March is paid {3}{U} with no blue mana at all - the Lattice lets colorless, white and black pay it (CR 609.4b).
# (march-of-the-machines-then-mycosynth-lattice-... is the other order, with the same outcome.)

